        <div class="guarantee-wrapper">
            <div class="payment-panel"><h3 class="panel-title"><i class="fas fa-wallet"></i> Accepted Payments</h3><div class="payment-group"><h4 style="color: #10b981; margin-bottom: 15px; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 600;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="margin-right: 5px;"></i> We Accept (Primary)</h4><div class="payment-methods"><div class="payment-item active-method"><i class="fas fa-mobile-alt"></i> Bkash<i class="fas fa-check-circle"></i></div><div class="payment-item active-method"><i class="fas fa-mobile-alt"></i> Nagad<i class="fas fa-check-circle"></i></div><div class="payment-item active-method"><i class="fab fa-bitcoin"></i> USDT (TRC20/BEP20)<i class="fas fa-check-circle"></i></div><div class="payment-item active-method"><i class="fab fa-btc"></i> Binance Pay / Balance<i class="fas fa-check-circle"></i></div></div></div><div class="payment-group" style="margin-bottom: 0;"><h4 style="color: #ef4444; margin-bottom: 15px; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 600;"><i class="fas fa-times-circle" style="margin-right: 5px;"></i> Not Accepted Directly</h4><div class="payment-methods"><div class="payment-item disabled-method"><i class="fab fa-paypal"></i> PayPal<span class="not-accepted-badge">Not Accepted</span></div><div class="payment-item disabled-method"><i class="fas fa-money-check-alt"></i> Payoneer<span class="not-accepted-badge">Not Accepted</span></div><div class="payment-item disabled-method"><i class="fas fa-exchange-alt"></i> Wise<span class="not-accepted-badge">Not Accepted</span></div><div class="payment-item disabled-method"><i class="fas fa-university"></i> Bank Transfer<span class="not-accepted-badge">Not Accepted</span></div></div><p style="font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--text-muted); margin-top: 18px; line-height: 1.6; padding: 12px; background: rgba(0,0,0,0.2); border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid var(--border-color);"><i class="fas fa-info-circle" style="color: var(--primary-color);"></i> We show these for information, but we currently don't accept them directly. Please use crypto/bKash methods, as Binance supports all crypto wallets for deposit.</p></div></div>
            <div class="guarantee-panel"><h3 class="panel-title"><i class="fas fa-shield-alt"></i> Our Working Policy</h3><ul class="guarantee-list"><li><i class="fas fa-handshake"></i><div><strong>Pay Only For Live & Published Reviews</strong><br><span style="font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--text-muted);">We charge only for reviews that are live and visible. We submit a daily report and you pay only for the live ones in that report.</span></div></li><li><i class="fas fa-lock"></i><div><strong>100% Manual & Safe Method</strong><br><span style="font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--text-muted);">We follow 100% manual Play Store search, install & review method. But as Google's policy changes frequently, we cannot provide any absolute guarantee - we work with the safest method possible.</span></div></li><li><i class="fas fa-file-invoice-dollar"></i><div><strong>Daily Report & Daily Payment</strong><br><span style="font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--text-muted);">We will add only the published reviews to our daily report. You just need to count the live reviews from the report and pay for those only. No extra charge.</span></div></li><li><i class="fas fa-ban"></i><div><strong>No Refill / No Money-Back Commitment</strong><br><span style="font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--text-muted);">Since we only take payment for reviews that are already published and live, there is no need for refill or refund policy. You pay for what you get.</span></div></li><li><i class="fas fa-headset"></i><div><strong>24/7 Live Support</strong><br><span style="font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--text-muted);">Always available to answer your queries and provide live updates on WhatsApp & Telegram.</span></div></li></ul></div>
        </div>
    </section>
    <section id="reviews" style="background-color: var(--surface-color);"><div class="section-header"><span class="badge">Proof of Work</span><h2>Delivered Excellence</h2><p>Real results from real campaigns. Browse through some of the authentic reviews we've successfully delivered for our global clients.</p></div><div class="gallery-grid" id="reviewsGrid"><div class="gallery-item" onclick="openModal('https://i.ibb.co.com/mVcbPvkH/Screenshot-20261017-172628.jpg')"><img src="https://i.ibb.co.com/mVcbPvkH/Screenshot-20261017-172628.jpg" alt="Review 1" loading="lazy"></div><div class="gallery-item" onclick="openModal('https://i.ibb.co.com/s9Z91s78/Screenshot-20261017-172704.jpg')"><img src="https://i.ibb.co.com/s9Z91s78/Screenshot-20261017-172704.jpg" alt="Review 2" loading="lazy"></div><div class="gallery-item" onclick="openModal('https://i.ibb.co.com/rfZS4sk5/Screenshot-20261017-172755.jpg')"><img src="https://i.ibb.co.com/rfZS4sk5/Screenshot-20261017-172755.jpg" alt="Review 3" loading="lazy"></div><div class="gallery-item" onclick="openModal('https://i.ibb.co.com/BHXRQd3M/Screenshot-20261017-172824.jpg')"><img src="https://i.ibb.co.com/BHXRQd3M/Screenshot-20261017-172824.jpg" alt="Review 4" loading="lazy"></div><div class="gallery-item" onclick="openModal('https://i.ibb.co.com/ZRmX1KD6/file-00000000a0c482119588a0de1452fd69.png')"><img src="https://i.ibb.co.com/ZRmX1KD6/file-00000000a0c482119588a0de1452fd69.png" alt="Review 5" loading="lazy"></div><div class="gallery-item" onclick="openModal('https://i.ibb.co.com/WWWyWh5j/file-00000000f3688211bf516c208be32272.png')"><img src="https://i.ibb.co.com/WWWyWh5j/file-00000000f3688211bf516c208be32272.png" alt="Review 6" loading="lazy"></div></div></section>
    <section id="about"><div class="section-header"><span class="badge">The Founder</span><h2>About Shakil</h2></div><div class="contact-wrapper" style="max-width: 1000px; margin: 0 auto; align-items: center;"><div style="text-align: center;"><img src="https://i.ibb.co.com/V0rL4WJN/IMG-20261017-142414-396.png" alt="Shakil" style="width: 250px; height: 250px; border-radius: 20px; object-fit: cover; border: 2px solid var(--border-color); box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);"></div><div><h3 style="font-size: 2rem; margin-bottom: 5px;">Meet Shakil</h3><h4 style="color: var(--primary-color); margin-bottom: 20px; font-weight: 500;">Founder & CEO, Google Marketing</h4><p style="color: var(--text-muted); margin-bottom: 15px;">Shakil is the founder of Google Marketing, a premium digital agency specializing in authentic online review services and Google Map SEO.</p><p style="color: var(--text-muted);">His commitment to transparency, quality, and 100% safe methods has made Google Marketing a trusted name.</p></div></div></section>
    <section id="faq" style="background-color: var(--surface-color);"><div class="section-header"><span class="badge">Clear Your Doubts</span><h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2><p>Everything you need to know about our honest working process.</p></div><div class="faq-container"><div class="faq-item"><div class="faq-question">Are your reviews safe for my app/business?<i class="fas fa-chevron-down"></i></div><div class="faq-answer">We use 100% manual method - real search, real install, real review. It's the safest method in the market. But we cannot give you 100% guarantee because Google Play / Map policy changes anytime and it's not our property.</div></div><div class="faq-item"><div class="faq-question">Will the reviews ever drop or disappear?<i class="fas fa-chevron-down"></i></div><div class="faq-answer">Reviews can drop anytime due to Google's algorithm. That's why our system is different - we charge you ONLY for reviews that are currently live. If any review drops, you don't need to pay for it.</div></div><div class="faq-item"><div class="faq-question">What payment methods do you accept?<i class="fas fa-chevron-down"></i></div><div class="faq-answer">We ONLY accept Bkash, Nagad, USDT (TRC20/BEP20), and Binance Pay / Binance Balance.</div></div></div></section>
    <section id="contact"><div class="section-header"><span class="badge">Let's Connect</span><h2>Start Your Project Today</h2><p>Fill out the details below and select your preferred platform to send us a direct message.</p></div><div class="contact-wrapper" style="max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto;"><div class="contact-info-panel"><h3>Contact Info</h3><p>We are available 24/7 to answer your queries and help your business grow.</p><div class="info-item"><div class="icon"><i class="fas fa-building"></i></div><div><p>Agency</p><p>Google Marketing</p></div></div><div class="info-item"><div class="icon"><i class="fab fa-whatsapp"></i></div><div><p>WhatsApp</p><p>+880 1647-323233</p></div></div><div class="info-item"><div class="icon"><i class="fab fa-telegram-plane"></i></div><div><p>Telegram</p><p>@DirectorShakil</p></div></div><div class="info-item"><div class="icon"><i class="fas fa-envelope"></i></div><div><p>Email</p><p>24.7.g00glemarketing@gmail.com</p></div></div></div><div class="custom-form"><div class="input-group"><label>App Name / Map Link / ID</label><input type="text" id="appName" placeholder="e.g. My App Name or Link" required></div><div class="input-group"><label>Your Contact Info</label><input type="text" id="userContact" placeholder="Your WhatsApp number or Email" required></div><div class="input-group"><label>Requirements / Message</label><textarea id="userMessage" rows="4" placeholder="Tell us what you need..."></textarea></div><button class="btn btn-primary" id="mainSubmitBtn" onclick="showOptions()" style="width: 100%; margin-top: 10px;">Choose Send Option <i class="fas fa-arrow-right"></i></button><div class="send-options" id="sendOptionsBlock"><p style="font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--text-muted); text-align: center; margin-bottom: 5px;">Send message via:</p><button class="btn btn-wa" onclick="sendMessage('whatsapp')"><i class="fab fa-whatsapp"></i> Send via WhatsApp</button><button class="btn btn-tg" onclick="sendMessage('telegram')"><i class="fab fa-telegram-plane"></i> Send via Telegram</button><button class="btn btn-mail" onclick="sendMessage('email')"><i class="fas fa-envelope"></i> Send via Email</button></div></div></div></section>
